	(text "USB-C device, 5 V only: CC1/CC2 each 5.1k to GND (separate resistors). SBU unused.\nShield to GND via 1M || 4.7n. ESD: USBLC6-2SC6 directly behind the connector.\nVBUS -> 500 mA PTC -> B5819W -> +5V (diode blocks back-feed from the header 5V pin into the host).\nAP2112K-3.3: 600 mA, EN tied to VIN, 1u in / 1u + 10u out (ceramic stable)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 190.5 0)
		(effects
